RATIONALE
The GPL-3.0-or-later implementation in this directory imports from
lib/core/ and lib/generated/meshtastic/ (GPL-3.0-only). Under GPL
section 5, any work that incorporates GPL code must itself be
distributed under the GPL. The Apache-2.0 grant above covers only the
protocol design — it does not override the GPL terms that apply to
this compiled Dart implementation.

In plain terms:
  - You MAY implement SIP/MRRP in your own project under Apache-2.0.
  - You MAY NOT copy, fork, or redistribute the Dart files in this
    directory under a non-GPL license.

MESHTASTIC DEPENDENCY NOTE
SIP frames are transported over Meshtastic radio packets. The
Meshtastic protobuf integration (lib/generated/meshtastic/) is
GPL-3.0-only per upstream (https://github.com/meshtastic/protobufs).
This creates a GPL-3.0-only floor for any combined binary that
includes both layers.
